an recorded &amp;rarr; No Boarding Scan&lt;br&gt;5. Boarded this route &amp;rarr; Invalid Journey&lt;br&gt;6. Sufficient credit (booking tokens exempt) &amp;rarr; Insufficient Credit&lt;br&gt;All pass &amp;rarr; Valid" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="560" width="320" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>